  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Join Casablanca Market's Affiliate Program and explore the richness of Morocco and the Mediterranean with our curated collection of handcrafted home accessories and gourmet artisanal foods!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">As a sustainable, women-owned, and operated business, we collaborate with talented artisans to bring you authentic, eco-friendly products that tell unique stories. Our global marketplace is dedicated to promoting artisan growth and empowerment, featuring best-selling items like Moroccan glassware, cooking tagines, market baskets, blankets, and condiments. By partnering with us as an affiliate, you'll enjoy flexible commissions while helping to preserve cultural heritage and promote environmental sustainability.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Reach out to toney@casablancamarket.com for more information, and join us on this exciting adventure!</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.44; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;\">Criteria to qualify for Casablanca Market Affiliate:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\">\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;\">\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.44; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Must have at least 1,000 followers on any major social media platform (Facebook, TikTok, YouTube, Twitter, and Instagram)&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;\">\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.44; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Must have at least one (1) post in the last 14 calendar days on any social media platform</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;\">\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.44; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Must be based in the USA</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.44; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;\">Please make sure to answer all the questions for faster approval of your application.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>",
